  deityInfoArray:
  - DeityName: Domain of Fate
    DeityDescription: Gods of Fate may discern if a chosen tile is Neutral, Blighted, or Sacred on their Divine Relic.
  - DeityName: Domain of Chaos
    DeityDescription: Gods of Chaos can move a placed tile on the board into a random spot on the board, determined by the Divine Relic.
  - DeityName: Domain of Death
    DeityDescription: Gods of Death can destroy a placed tile, returning that tile into the deck for redistribution and reuse.
  - DeityName: Domain of Protection
    DeityDescription: Gods of Protection can protect a tile from rearrangement, or destruction, for one turn.
  - DeityName: Domain of Illusion
    DeityDescription: Gods of Illusion can exchange the spots of two placed tiles, aside from root tiles.
