  playerTypesArray:
  - PlayerTypeDesignation: Creator
    PlayerTypeDetails: You have the power to place tiles on whatever spots you may please, guided by your limited insight of which are which,
  - PlayerTypeDesignation: Creator
    PlayerTypeDetails: You have the power to place tiles on whatever spots you may please, guided by your limited insight of which are which,
